// @id ovw-quality
// @tab overview
// @title Evidence quality (stale / no data / unknown are never green)
// @viz barchart+table
// @note Evidence quality is separate from the reported state. Only quality == Fresh with reportedState == Compliant is green.
// @note Counts machines x family over ALL machines in scope (including NotEligible and Unknown eligibility), so totals differ from the coverage denominator.
// @note ARG does not expose Unsupported, AccessDenied, ProviderUnavailable, Partial or CollectionFailure; those qualities need collector (I05/I08) evidence.
// @nodata No machines in scope.
//#include evidence
| summarize machinesCount = count(), green = countif(green) by family, quality
| order by family asc, quality asc
